{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04907","headline":"人日重宴大明宫恩赐彩缕人胜应制 · 李乂","name":"人日重宴大明宫恩赐彩缕人胜应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诘旦行春上苑中，凭高却下大明宫。\n千年执象寰瀛泰，七日爲人庆赏隆。\n铁凤曾骞摇瑞雪，铜乌细转入祥风。\n此时朝野欢无算，此岁云天乐未穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李乂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04907.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04907","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}